; Ontology: Autonomous Pesticide Spraying Drone -- Energy Budget Domain
; Standards: EPPO PP 1/213(3):2012,    EU Regulation 2009/128/EC,
;            EASA Reg.(EU) 2019/947,   ISO 16119-4:2014, ICAO Annex 2:2005
; Fragment: QF_LRA (Quantifier-Free Linear Real Arithmetic)
;
; IMPORTANT: Sorts, functions, relations, and base axioms in this file
; are consistent with Definition 5 / Example 1 of the paper.
; The paper's Example 1 establishes this domain as the canonical running
; example for the SemAlign framework validation.
;
; Ontology construction methodology:
;   STEP 1: Governing standards identified
;           - EPPO PP 1/213(3):2012 (efficacy evaluation, precision spraying)
;           - EU Regulation 2009/128/EC (sustainable use of pesticides)
;           - EASA Regulation (EU) 2019/947 (UAS rules and procedures)
;           - ISO 16119-4:2014 (agricultural sprayer environmental requirements)
;           - ICAO Annex 2:2005 (rules of the air, UAS operations)
;   STEP 2: Vocabulary extracted from standards data dictionaries
;           - EPPO PP 1/213(3) Sec.4.2: active substance application rate per hectare
;           - EPPO PP 1/213(3) Sec.3.1: target area coverage definition
;           - EU 2009/128/EC Art.12 + Annex II: aerial application GPS zone control
;           - EASA 2019/947 UAS.OPEN.040: operational battery capacity limit
;           - ISO 16119-4 Clause 6: coverage uniformity per hectare
;           - ICAO Annex 2 Sec.3.1.9: flight time and UAS operational limits
;   STEP 3: Normative requirement clauses formalised as FOL axioms (SMT-LIB2 prefix)
;           - EPPO PP 1/213(3) Sec.4.2: consumption per hectare <= 50 (cons_upper axioms)
;           - EASA 2019/947 UAS.OPEN.040: battery_capacity = 500 (bat_cap axiom)
;           - EU 2009/128/EC Art.12: buffer_zone_width = 5m (buffer_val axiom)
;           - ISO 16119-4: min_coverage_per_hectare = 40 (min_coverage axiom)
;           - EASA 2019/947: battery_reserve = 50 (bat_reserve axiom)
;           - ICAO Annex 2: max_flight_time = 300 (max_flight axiom)

; === SORTS === (exactly as in Example 1 of the paper)
sort Hectare      ; unit of land area -- discrete field zones
sort Real         ; real-valued energy consumption
sort Nat          ; natural-valued indices

; === FUNCTIONS === (exactly as in Example 1 of the paper)
fun consumption      : Hectare -> Real  ; energy to cover hectare h (EPPO PP 1/213(3))
fun num_hectares     : Nat              ; total hectares in current mission
fun total_consumption: Real             ; cumulative energy used so far
fun battery_capacity : Real             ; total battery energy available (EASA 2019/947)

; === RELATIONS === (exactly as in Example 1 of the paper)
rel covered          : Hectare          ; holds when hectare h has been fully sprayed

; === AXIOMS === (exactly as in Example 1 of the paper)
; Number of hectares in mission (EPPO PP 1/213(3) standard field size)
axiom num_h         : (= num_hectares 10)
; Battery capacity: 500 units (EASA 2019/947 UAS.OPEN.040 manufacturer specification)
axiom bat_cap       : (= battery_capacity 500)
; Energy consumption per hectare is non-negative
axiom nn_consumption: (>= (consumption 1) 0)
; Per-hectare consumption bounded by EPPO PP 1/213(3) Sec.4.2 application rate limit:
axiom cons_upper    : (<= (consumption 1) 50)
axiom cons_upper_2  : (<= (consumption 2) 50)
axiom cons_upper_3  : (<= (consumption 3) 50)
axiom cons_upper_4  : (<= (consumption 4) 50)
axiom cons_upper_5  : (<= (consumption 5) 50)
; Total consumption is non-negative and bounded by battery capacity
axiom total_nn      : (>= total_consumption 0)

; === EXTENDED AXIOMS (EPPO PP 1/213(3) / EU 2009/128/EC / EASA / ISO / ICAO) ===

; Per-hectare application rate limit (EPPO PP 1/213(3) Sec.4.2)
; Maximum active substance dose per hectare: 50 units
fun max_per_hectare_dose : Real
axiom max_dose_val  : (= max_per_hectare_dose 50)

; EU 2009/128/EC Article 12 buffer zone requirement:
; No spray within 5 metres of water bodies (modelled as minimum boundary constraint)
fun buffer_zone_width : Real
axiom buffer_val    : (= buffer_zone_width 5)

; ISO 16119-4:2014 coverage uniformity:
; Minimum effective spray per hectare to achieve 85% coverage uniformity
fun min_coverage_per_hectare : Real
axiom min_coverage  : (= min_coverage_per_hectare 40)

; Battery safety margin (EASA 2019/947 UAS.OPEN.040 reserve requirement):
; Must retain 50 units of battery capacity as navigation reserve
fun battery_reserve : Real
axiom bat_reserve   : (= battery_reserve 50)

; ICAO Annex 2:2005 maximum flight time per sortie (in time units):
; Limits continuous UAS operation to maintain VLOS requirements
fun max_flight_time : Real
axiom max_flight    : (= max_flight_time 300)
